{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807250/extras/149d7424d7c2e53c3ee57b5575f146c2.avif?t=1774485912\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807250/extras_big/149d7424d7c2e53c3ee57b5575f146c2.avif?t=1774485912 width=800 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a pixel-style card game with over 30 hero cards for you to choose from. Each hero card has its own unique skill, including warriors, mages, supports, controllers, tanks, and various other types. The selection of different characters builds diverse battle formations, bringing you a unique experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807250/extras/InfoBG1.png?t=1774485912\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807250/extras/infobg5-export?t=1774485912\" /></span> \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you challenge enemies with your favorite lineup, remember that there is also a powerful equipment system for you to choose from. With 7 basic equipment types, the rich synthesis upgrade system can derive over 50+ types of equipment. Rich equipment combined with variously positioned hero cards makes lineup construction more flexible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807250/extras/InfoBG2.png?t=1774485912\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807250/extras/infobg5-export?t=1774485912\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be cautious, the enemy is not just shrimp soldiers and crab generals! There is also a potion and scroll system to assist you in your journey! There are 8 potions and over 20 scrolls for you to use. The rational use of potions and scrolls will achieve unexpected effects!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807250/extras/InfoBG3.png?t=1774485912\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807250/extras/infobg5-export?t=1774485912\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 game modes, 10+ scenes, 10 bosses, and 30+ enemies/formation for you to conquer! March on triumphantly, MY HERO!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807250/extras/InfoBG4.png?t=1774485912\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategy card</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatic Battle</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3807250?t=1774485912","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3807250?t=1774485912","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807250/76183916c165c372f6a6758c868551b10b6f5d0b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774485912","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807250/76183916c165c372f6a6758c868551b10b6f5d0b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774485912","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807250/extras/149d7424d7c2e53c3ee57b5575f146c2.avif?t=1774485912\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807250/extras_big/149d7424d7c2e53c3ee57b5575f146c2.avif?t=1774485912 width=800 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a pixel-style card game with over 30 hero cards for you to choose from. Each hero card has its own unique skill, including warriors, mages, supports, controllers, tanks, and various other types. The selection of different characters builds diverse battle formations, bringing you a unique experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta